# Gate 0 application. It exists only to prove that a Rust RV32IMAFDC/ILP32D
# staticlib links into official Luban-Lite firmware and agrees with the C
# compiler on the psABI. It deliberately contains no UI, no QuickJS and no GE.
#
# The runtime itself lives in application/rt-thread/pocketjs-smoke/third_party/pocketjs; this app is the
# entry point that drives it.

